<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is an easy to use and simple reset macro, bind  reset building to ''g" in the game and assign the macro to any keybind you want, then you're done, you higher/lower delay depending on how fast you want the building to reset. Lower = Faster Higher = Slower</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 10 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 0 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 0 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 10 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>